# Code owners for loxilb-ui. Handles are taken from MAINTAINERS.md.
#
# Every pull request requires an approving review from these maintainers before it can be
# merged. This is enforced by the branch-protection rule on `main`
# ("Require review from Code Owners" + at least 1 approval).
#
# Every listed owner must have write access to the repository, otherwise GitHub ignores
# them and warns. A team (e.g. @loxilb-io/loxilb-ui-maintainers) may be used instead of
# individual handles so membership can change without editing this file.
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern for a path wins.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owners — the loxilb-ui maintainers, plus the loxilb-devel review
# account, mirroring loxilb-inference-gateway.
#
# loxilb-devel is listed HERE ONLY, by the same decision the gateway records.
# Because the last matching pattern wins, it is auto-requested for paths no
# narrower pattern below claims — not for the governance paths, which have
# their own owner lines. Widen it by adding the handle to those lines too;
# adding it here again will not do it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*       @backguynn @inhogog2 @loxilb-devel

